# MedShadow Component Patterns

## Feature Cards
Feature cards should follow this pattern:
```jsx
<div className="group">
  <div className="card bg-[#F8FAFC] p-8 text-center rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md group-hover:border-[#FCA311]/30 transition-all duration-300 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div className="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FCA311] to-[#FCA311]/60"></div>
    <div className="relative w-20 h-20 mx-auto mb-6 bg-white rounded-full p-4 shadow-sm">
      <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-[#FCA311]/10 rounded-full group-hover:bg-[#FCA311]/20 transition-colors duration-300"></div>
      <Image src="/images/icon.svg" alt="Feature" fill className="object-contain p-4" />
    </div>
    <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-[#14213D]">Feature Title</h3>
    <p className="text-[#4B5563] mb-6">Feature description text</p>
    <div className="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-neutral-200">
      <Link href="/link" className="inline-flex items-center text-[#FCA311] font-medium">
        <span className="mr-2">Learn more</span>
        <svg>...</svg>
      </Link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

## Section Headers
Section headers should follow this pattern:
```jsx
<div className="text-center mb-16">
  <span className="inline-block px-4 py-1 bg-[#E5E7EB] text-[#4B5563] rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-4">
    Section Label
  </span>
  <h2 className="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-[#14213D]">Section Title</h2>
  <p className="text-lg text-[#4B5563] max-w-2xl mx-auto">
    Section description text
  </p>
</div>
```

## Opportunity Cards
Opportunity cards should follow this pattern:
```jsx
<div className="group">
  <div className="overflow-hidden bg-white rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 shadow-sm group-hover:shadow-md transition-all duration-300">
    <div className="relative h-56 bg-[#4F46E5]">
      <Image src="/images/image.jpg" alt="Title" fill className="object-cover mix-blend-overlay opacity-60" />
      <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#4F46E5]/80 to-transparent"></div>
      <div className="absolute top-4 right-4 bg-white/90 text-[#14213D] font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-sm">
        Category
      </div>
    </div>
    <div className="p-6">
      <h3 className="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-[#14213D]">Opportunity Title</h3>
      <p className="text-[#4B5563] mb-4">Opportunity description</p>
      <div className="flex justify-between items-center">
        <span className="text-[#FCA311] font-medium">Location</span>
        <Link href="/link" className="bg-[#14213D] hover:bg-[#1A365D] text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg">
          View Details
        </Link>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```
